+# MASTER7 v157 member guide polish
+
+Release: `17.0.0-selfbuilt.157-member-guide-polish`
+
+This release completes the English-first water-blue member presentation started
+in v156.
+
+- Customer quick guides use clear English text throughout the member portal.
+- The guide summary uses `Member guide · How it works` instead of the former
+  Chinese technical label.
+- Member guides now use a subtle white and water-blue card with navy text,
+  matching the customer shell instead of the old black technical panel.
+- Administrative guide styling and all backoffice functions remain unchanged.
+
+At 393 px viewport width the customer page remains free of horizontal overflow.
+Game and payment availability, launch controls, wallet controls and real-money
+switches are unchanged and remain subject to their existing acceptance gates.
